      "advice": "A new peak that is not a multiple of running speed is typical of bearing damage. Add the bearing number for this channel in knowledge/machines.json to identify which part."
    },
    {
      "id": "bearing_late_stage",
      "name": "Advanced bearing wear",
      "requires": [],
