          "negate": true,
          "weight": 2,
          "key": true
        }
      ],
      "advice": "Twice line frequency suggests stator, air gap or supply problems. Check phase currents. On 2-pole motors this is close to 2x running speed; a longer spectrum resolution separates them."
    },
